QCSIS modern Fortran translation

Based on QCSIS 0.1 by Xuejun Ma, Jingxiao Zhang, and Jingke Zhou.
Original package publication date: 2015-12-02.
Original license: GPL-2.

This distribution translates the computational routines to modern Fortran,
adds FPM packaging, validation, tests, and examples, and omits plotting code
(the upstream package contained no plotting routines in its R source).
